{"task_type": "build", "component": "build_write_service_watchdog", "description": "Build a watchdog for the WriteService (DuckDB write layer on port 8772). The service has been intermittently dead since 2026-04-30 causing registry_promoter_daemon heartbeat failures. Watchdog should: check port 8772 every 60s, detect connection refused, restart the write_service process via supervisorctl, log restart events to mesh_events table once service recovers, alert via a file flag at /home/workspace/logs/write_service_down.flag when down. Must not restart more than 3 times per hour to avoid flap loops.", "priority": "high", "confidence": 0.95}